(HR Leave and Absence Policy v1.3) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 1 ? Annual Leave Entitlement) Tj T*
(Full-time employees are entitled to 25 days annual leave per year.) Tj T*
(Part-time employees receive leave on a pro-rata basis.) Tj T*
(Leave must be approved by the direct manager at least 2 weeks in advance.) Tj T*
(Unused leave may be carried over up to a maximum of 5 days per year.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 2 ? Sick Leave) Tj T*
(Employees are entitled to 10 days paid sick leave per year.) Tj T*
(A doctor's certificate is required for absences of 3 or more consecutive days.) Tj T*
(Sick leave does not carry over to the following year.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
