(HR Leave and Absence Policy v1.3 ? Page 2) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 3 ? Parental Leave) Tj T*
(Primary caregivers are entitled to 26 weeks of parental leave.) Tj T*
(Secondary caregivers are entitled to 4 weeks of parental leave.) Tj T*
(Parental leave must be requested at least 8 weeks before the expected start date.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 4 ? Disciplinary Absence) Tj T*
(Unauthorised absence of more than 3 consecutive days may result in dismissal.) Tj T*
(Employees must notify their manager before 9am on any day of unplanned absence.) Tj T*
(Repeated unplanned absences will trigger a formal attendance review.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
